WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:04.620
What happens to a wastebin of discarded&nbsp;
papers when it's placed in The Clockworks?

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:08.700
Jr. Researcher Kramer selected a metal&nbsp;
mesh wastebin filled with discarded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.600
papers from his office, and prepared&nbsp;
it for experimentation. The test was&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.160
intended to show what SCP-914 would&nbsp;
do with something it deemed worthless.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:22.980
The bin and its contents were placed inside&nbsp;
of SCP-914 on the setting "Fine." The output&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:27.060
produced was the same bin, but with all&nbsp;
of the papers replaced with pictures of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:32.340
Jr. Researcher Kramer. The word "trash"&nbsp;
was stamped over all of them in red ink.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.700
Jr. Researcher Kramer simply&nbsp;
noted the word, “Harsh.”

